        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Robert Holdstock, H. L. Mencken\n- Works: Mythago Wood\n- Topics: Fantasy literature, mythic fiction, American English\n\nFacts:\n- H. L. Mencken was born on September 12, 1880, and died on January 29, 1956.\n- H. L. Mencken was an American journalist, satirist, cultural critic, and scholar of American English.\n- Robert Holdstock was born on 2 August 1948 and died on 29 November 2009.\n- Robert Holdstock was an English novelist and author best known for Celtic, Nordic, Gothic, and Pictish fantasy literature, mainly in the subgenre of mythic fiction.\n- Mythago Wood is a fantasy novel by British writer Robert Holdstock.\n- Mythago Wood was published in the United Kingdom in 1984.",
